      "id": "qtm-m2-quartiles-iqr-c1",
      "heading": "Quartiles and percentiles",
      "explanation_md": "**Quartiles** split ordered data into **four groups**, and each quartile is a specific percentile:\n- **First quartile Q1 = 25th percentile**\n- **Second quartile Q2 = 50th percentile = the median**\n- **Third quartile Q3 = 75th percentile**\n\nThe slide draws this on a line from **Min** to **Max**: 25% of the data lies between Min and Q1, 50% between Min and the median, 75% between Min and Q3, and 50% lies on each side of the median.",
